643T286 582T247 514T224 455Q219 439 186 308T152 168Q151 163 151 147Q151 99 173 68Q204 26 260 26Q302 26 349 51T425 137Q441 171 449 214T457 279Q457 337 422 372Q380 358 347 358H337Q258 358 258 389Q258 396 261 403Q275 431 353 431Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-3B2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"801\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> of our model can be written as</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"26.875ex\" height=\"12.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -6.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -2657.1 11571.3 5385.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n\\underbrace{\\widehat{\\,\\beta}_0}_{\\:\\: \\textrm{point} <span>\\</span> \\textrm{estimate}} \\: \\pm \\: \\overbrace{t_{n-2,\\alpha/2} \\cdot \\underbrace{\\textrm{SE}[\\widehat{\\,\\beta}_0\\,]}_{\\textrm{standard} <span>\\</span> \\,\\:\\: \\textrm{error}}}^{\\textrm{margin of error}}.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-3B2\" d=\"M29 -194Q23 -188 23 -186Q23 -183 102 134T186 465Q208 533 243 584T309 658Q365 705 429 705H431Q493 705 533 667T573 570Q573 465 469 396L482 383Q533 332 533 252Q533 139 448 65T257 -10Q227 -10 203 -2T165 17T143 40T131 59T126 65L62 -188Q60 -194 42 -194H29ZM353 431Q392 431 427 419L432 422Q436 426 439