15 17Q309 13 296 6T270 -6Q250 -11 231 -11Q185 -11 150 11T104 82Q103 89 103 113Q103 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E23-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E23-MJMAIN-5E\" d=\"M112 560L249 694L257 686Q387 562 387 560L361 531Q359 532 303 581L250 627L195 580Q182 569 169 557T148 538L140 532Q138 530 125 546L112 560Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E23-MJSZ1-2C6\" d=\"M279 669Q273 669 142 610T9 551L0 569Q-8 585 -8 587Q-8 588 -7 588L12 598Q30 608 66 628T136 666L277 744L564 587L555 569Q549 556 547 554T544 552Q539 555 410 612T279 669Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E23-MJMAIN-29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E23-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJSZ2-2211\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(147,-1090)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-69\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"345\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1124\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"721\" y=\"1627\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"1444\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1834,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-69\" x=\"693\" y=\"-213\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"2891\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3891,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"166\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJSZ1-2C6\" x=\"58\" y=\"1\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMATHI-69\" x=\"939\" y=\"-342\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(4900,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E23-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"550\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> gives the sum of the squared residuals of our regression model. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Even considering the entire population, the data points will not fall on a perfectly straight line. Thus, errors are present even in the \"true\" regression model. These errors have some (unknown) variance, which we'll denote as <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"3.032ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -934.9 1305.3 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-24-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-24-Title\">\\sigma^2.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMATHI-3C3\" d=\"M184 -11Q116 -11 74 34T31 147Q31 247 104 333T274 430Q275 431 414 431H552Q553 430 555 429T559 427T562 425T565 422T567 420T569 416T570 412T571 407T572 401Q572 357 507 357Q500 357 490 357T476 358H416L421 348Q439 310 439 263Q439 153 359 71T1